  itemDetailsList:
  - itemName: 4
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbc6c86941f95fe44b04e95f280b2819, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: The candle is lighted...
  - itemName: 5
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0eb5a74e5d2b0154a8681a89c3b262cb, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A large, ornate brooch bearing the crest of the Hold family, hidden
      in the saddle bag in the stables. The pin is exceptionally sharp and coated
      in blood.

      The brooch appears to be missing one of its jewels...'
  - itemName: 6
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A torn letter penned by Admiral Hold filing for divorce from his wife,
      Theodosia. The letter is dated the day before his death. The reason for the
      divorce is not listed. Or perhaps it was written on the other half of the page...?
  - itemName: 9
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A note from Theodosia Hold to Admiral Charles Hold requesting he refrain
      from dismissing the maid, Dorothy Tendwell, over a late breakfast.
  - itemName: 10
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: You picked it up!
  - itemName: 11
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 1
    itemInfo: A bloody hand is imprinted on the windowsill. A trail of blood  runs
      from the windowsill towards the stables...
  - itemName: 12
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A pair of gloves found in Maximillian's room. Once white, now stained
      red with blood. They are monogrammed with Theodosia Hold's initials.
  - itemName: 13
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A portrait of the Hold Family. A very large brooch is pinned to the
      Admiral's chest.
  - itemName: 14
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 0
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 1
    itemInfo: A delicate wooden trellis attached to the side of the house, sitting
      just above a window on the second floor. Several of its crossbars have been
      snapped in two, as though someone recently climbed up...
  - itemName: 7
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A love letter between two unnamed persons, found in the stables. It
      reads as follows:

      "My love, I have done as you asked. I have left you
      a special letter somewhere secret. Like our love, its fiery passion is caged
      by day, but burns bright at night."'
  - itemName: 8
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A love letter between two unnamed persons, found in Theodosia Hold''s
      purse. It reads as follows:

      "My love, these past few nights have been
      cold without you by my side. Would you leave me some small token to remind
      me of you? Leave it in our secret spot. Like our love, its fiery passion is
      caged by day, but burns bright at night."'
  - itemName: 30
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A key to Max's room.
  - itemName: 17
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: "A particularly risqu\xE9 love letter written by Dorothy Tendwell addressed
      to Lavender Ditch. It includes a particularly saucy sketch of Dorothy's ankle.\n\"Lavender,
      my love,\nI have included the drawing you requested. I  hope you will visit
      me tonight again so you can see, touch- and taste- the real thing.\nForever
      yours, Dorothy \""
  - itemName: 27
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A pair of gloves with Maximillian's monogrammed initials. Theodosia
      is wearing them, for some strange reason.
  - itemName: 18
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 1
    notPickedUp: 1
    itemInfo: A bucket full of blood-tainted water. Perhaps the killer used this
      to wash the blood from their hands...?
  - itemName: 21
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 1
    notPickedUp: 1
    itemInfo: A messy pile of hay covered in blood. You think the killer may have
      tried to wipe the blood from their hands here...
  - itemName: 23
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A copy of The Iliad. The inside of the front cover reads: "Property
      of Avery Hold"'
  - itemName: 28
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A pair of frilly women''s underwear found in Maximillian''s room,
      monogrammed with the initials "T.H." You assume they are Theodosia''s...

'
  - itemName: 19
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'The burnt remains of a divorce petition penned by Admiral Hold. Most
      of the letter is burnt beyond legibility, but one word has survived the fire:
      "Adultery."'
  - itemName: 29
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A letter of dismissal  written by Admiral Charles Hold addressed to
      Dorothy Tendwell, found in Dorothy's back pocket. The letter stipulates that
      Dorothy has until the end of the week to make alternative living arrangements,
      at which point she will be removed from Wenchwatch Hall. The letter cites poor
      performance as the reason for dismissal.
  - itemName: 20
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A rather stale jam scone found in Avery Hold''s back pocket.

      It
      appears to be covered in horse hair'
  - itemName: 24
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A light pink shade of lipstick found in Theodosia's purse.
  - itemName: 25
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 0
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: A strange pink mark on Maximillian's neck. It appears to be a lipstick
      smudge...
  - itemName: 22
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    value: 6
    isEvidence: 1
    notRecordedInJournal: 0
    notPickedUp: 0
    itemInfo: 'A pile of coins extorted from Dorothy. There must be at least a week''s
      wages here! '
